  "contentHtml": "<div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34eeb45f4651e5ab353d224688e6e07fc0fd7447\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/34eeb45f4651e5ab353d224688e6e07fc0fd7447\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b67d5e60aaa8001b464764ac0f23e59638191b9d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b67d5e60aaa8001b464764ac0f23e59638191b9d\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6c7829f706d413f5b28dd0a031f754642b4460d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c6c7829f706d413f5b28dd0a031f754642b4460d\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e2ec8c76f36aa815185123e3d0e5da14200d499\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4e2ec8c76f36aa815185123e3d0e5da14200d499\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/645c400908080f14a766a312277aa53250c3c873\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/645c400908080f14a766a312277aa53250c3c873\" data-origin-width=\"1280\" data-origin-height=\"720\"></div><p>얼마 전 컴백한 아이돌 아이브의 컨셉이 <b>빛의 삼원색</b>이길래 수업에 사용하기 좋을 듯하여 글을 남겨봅니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>중2 &#39;1. 물질의 구성&#39;단원 불꽃 반응 수업 시 1학년 내용 복습하는 겸 보여주셔도 좋을 듯 합니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b>영상은 아이브(IVE)라는 아이돌의 &#39;애프터 라이크(AFTER LIKE)&#39;</b>라는 곡입니다.</p><p>(음이 익숙하실 수 있는데 1997 진주의 &#39;난 괜찮아&#39; (I WILL SURVIVE, 원곡 글로리아 게이너)를 샘플링한 곡이라 그렇습니다.)</p><p>&#160;</p><p><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">멤버들 6명이 각자 빛의 삼원색 중 한 색깔을 맡았습니다.&#160;</span></b></p><p><b><span style=\"color: #006dd7;\">멤버들이 단체로 모여서 춤을 출 때는 흰색 의상을 입기 때문에 빛의 합성에 대해 친근하게 접근할 수 있을 겁니다!</span></b></p><p>&#160;</p><p>MV에서는 의상 색깔이 잘 보이고</p><p>무대 영상은 무대 조명색이 바뀌어서 좀 더 선명하게 색을 확인할 수 있습니다.</p><p>두 영상 중 아무거나 보여주셔도 좋을 듯 합니다.</p><p>정말 대충 만든 PPT라도 올리려 하는데 첨부가 안되네요..???? ㅇㅅㅇ;;;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>대단한 자료는 아니지만 늘 선생님들 도움만 받고 있기에 하나 올려봅니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;MV&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/F0B7HDiY-10\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/F0B7HDiY-10</a></p><p><a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=1s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:01</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 빨/초/파/청록/자홍/노랑 색이 일렬로 나타납니다.</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=4s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:04</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 초록(레이)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=12s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:12</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 노랑(이서)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=19s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:19</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 청록(리즈)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=26s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:26</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 자홍(유진)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=35s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:35</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 여러명의 멤버가 함께 모였기 때문에 흰색 의상을 입고 각자가 맡은 색 악세서리를 하고 있습니다.</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=65s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">1:05</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 빨강(원영)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=80s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">1:20</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 파랑(가을)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=127s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">2:07</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 색그림자 활용한 촬영 기법과 연관지어 설명하기 좋은 장면이라 생각했습니다.</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=F0B7HDiY-10&amp;t=158s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">2:38</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> (중2) 불꽃 반응에서 폭죽의 색이 다양함을 보여주기 좋습니다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&lt;무대영상&gt;</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/3eDQcIqgLIA\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/3eDQcIqgLIA</a>&#160;</p><p><a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=39s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">0:39</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 시작</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=61s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">1:01</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 레이(초록)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=69s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">1:09</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 이서(노랑)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=76s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">1:16</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 리즈(청록)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=84s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">1:24</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 유진(자홍)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=125s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">2:05</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 원영(빨강)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=137s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">2:17</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 가을(파랑)</span> <a style=\"color: var(--yt-endpoint-color,var(--yt-spec-call-to-action)); background-color: #f9f9f9;\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3eDQcIqgLIA&amp;t=145s\" target=\"_top\" class=\"ke-link\">2:25</a><span style=\"color: #030303;\"> 리즈(청록)</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->"
